# Normalise line endings to LF in the repo AND the working tree, on every OS.
# Without this, Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true get CRLF files and
# Prettier (endOfLine: lf) fails locally while CI on Linux passes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
